e_chapter__grtAe">15</strong><h1>Design YouTube</h1></header><p>In this cha=
pter, you are asked to design YouTube. The solution to this question can be=
 applied to other interview questions like designing a video sharing platfo=
rm such as Netflix and Hulu. Figure 1 shows the YouTube homepage.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a screenshot of the YouTube website's homep=
