<h4 id=3D"speed-optimization-place-upload-centers-close-to-users">Speed opt=
imization: place upload centers close to users</h4>
<p>Another way to improve the upload speed is by setting up multiple upload=
 centers across the globe (Figure 24). People in the United States can uplo=
ad videos to the North America upload center, and people in China can uploa=
d videos to the Asian upload center. To achieve this, we use CDN as upload =
centers.</p>
