<h4 id=3D"safety-optimization-pre-signed-upload-url">Safety optimization: p=
re-signed upload URL</h4>
<p>Safety is one of the most important aspects of any product. To ensure on=
ly authorized users upload videos to the right location, we introduce pre-s=
igned URLs as shown in Figure 27.</p>
